  {
    "id": "1946740331132895701",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "靠AI“抽卡”能解决的问题很有限。AI第一次就做不好的事情，很可能再做十次都做不好，这是因为碰到了AI的“认知盲区”了。这个时候不是再进行盲目“抽卡”，而是下手去分析原因，把无法有效自动化的部分单独处理掉",
    "created_at": "2025-07-20T01:13:58.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1946739509791531179",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "“什么可以自动化”、“什么不可以自动化”是同样重要的问题。\n\n如果需要重复100遍，直接编程来解决；需要重复10遍，直接交给AI来处理；只需要做一次，直接手动处理。\n\n此外，还有需要深思熟虑的工作，需要我们创造更适合思考的环境来斟酌。",
    "created_at": "2025-07-20T01:10:42.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
      "mentions": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "1946736852381421643",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "@ThinkWithSophie 他们的失误与任性的代价还是太低廉了。\n\n这件事情让人感觉官方的公关目标只有甩锅，懒得给大众提供逻辑链完整的回复，这应该是官僚的“技术含量”逐渐下降的结果。\n\n当然，网上太多“二极管”，理性的声音也没有什么存在空间。也算是一种“双向选择”了---“非理性的舆论”与“不负责的官方”匹配得很好",
    "created_at": "2025-07-20T01:00:08.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 0,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [],
      "hashtags": [],
